/**
 * Phishing Simulation — Security awareness training platform.
 *
 * Used by Security Awareness Trainers, HR, CISOs, and Compliance Officers.
 * Full campaign lifecycle management: draft → scheduled → running → completed.
 *
 * Features:
 * - Campaign creation & tracking with per-department breakdowns
 * - 12 phishing template library across 6 categories
 * - Department risk scoring (click rate, credential capture, report rate)
 * - Training module assignment to clickers
 * - Awareness trend reporting over last 6 campaigns
 *
 * Data source: Supabase `phishing_campaigns` table.
 * Templates, departments, and training modules remain as static UI constants
 * (no dedicated tables exist for them yet).
 */

